Package: cropyieldmodel
Type: Package
Title: Transparent Regional Statistical Crop Yield Modelling
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mohammad Reza", "Eini", email = "80261978+MR-Eini@users.noreply.github.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Fits, tunes, evaluates, compares, and ensembles regional
    statistical crop yield models from monthly weather and yield panels.
    The package implements chronological rolling-origin validation,
    leakage-safe preprocessing, partial pooling, robust regression,
    distributed-lag smoothing, residual autoregression, empirical prediction
    intervals, and area-weighted aggregation. Every high-level workflow
    returns row-level predictions and tuning results so that model selection
    and reported scores can be audited.
